{"seq":3,"slug":"mcp-and-tool-protocols","title":"Mcp And Tool Protocols","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-mcp-solves","title":"MCP 解决什么问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols/what-mcp-solves","wordCount":1978,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"exposing-capabilities-as-tools","title":"把能力暴露为工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols/exposing-capabilities-as-tools","wordCount":1975,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-and-trust-boundaries","title":"安全与信任边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols/security-and-trust-boundaries","wordCount":1955,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲把能力标准化地暴露给 agent 的协议层,以 MCP(Model Context Protocol)为代表:MCP 解决什么问题——用一个开放标准让任意工具/数据源可被任意 AI 应用接入,免去 N×M 的私有集成;怎么把你的能力暴露为工具——把 API、数据、动作包装成 agent 可发现可调用的工具;以及安全与信任边界——当 agent 能调用真实工具、操作真实系统,如何用权限、确认、隔离守住安全。\n"}